+
+# 90. HUD DESIGN
+
+Create original motorsport UI.
+
+HUD data:
+
+- speed
+- RPM
+- gear
+- throttle
+- brake
+- ERS
+- battery
+- fuel
+- lap
+- position
+- delta
+- flags
