+# 103. UNIT TESTS
+
+Use Vitest.
+
+Test:
+
+- interpolation
+- curve sampling
+- slip computation
+- friction ellipse
+- aero equations
+- drivetrain ratio
+- brake distribution
+- track progress
+- race state
+- setup serialization
