+---
+
+# 117. PLAYWRIGHT TESTS
+
+Automate:
+
+- game loads
+- menu navigation
+- session start
+- pause
+- settings
+- graphics changes
+- reset
+- results screen
+
+Check browser console.
+
+No unhandled exceptions.
+
+---
+
+# 118. PERFORMANCE REGRESSION
+
+Record benchmark.
+
+Store:
+
+- mean FPS
+- p1 FPS
+- CPU frame time
+- draw calls
+- triangle count
+
+Reject major unexplained regressions.
