+## Geometry pass
+
+Find:
+
+- blocky assets
+- visibly low-poly curves
+- empty environments
+- repeated obvious props
+
+Fix.
+
+## Material pass
+
+Find:
+
+- uniform roughness
+- plastic-looking carbon
+- incorrect metallic surfaces
+- flat road
+
+Fix.
+
+## Lighting pass
+
+Find:
+
+- washed highlights
+- dead shadows
+- flat scene
+- unrealistic exposure
+
+Fix.
+
+## Motion pass
+
+Find:
+
+- static suspension
+- wheel jitter
+- rigid driver hands
+- dead environment
+
+Fix.
+
